I am also seeing worse convergance on some simple GAN's with MNIST,
e.g. the tutorial example, using the newer adam vs the 1.4 version,
but I don't have a good way to reproduce this yet.
the GAN's produce noticeably less convincing digits than using the 1.4 version for the same settings and number of iterations.
